Author: Roman Mohr <rmohr@redhat.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 25 12:10:02 2021 +0100

    Switch from RSA to EC keys for ssh connections
    
    EC keys are there for a very long time and some distros now start
    disabling RSA by default.
    
    Signed-off-by: Roman Mohr <rmohr@redhat.com>

commit f8883807e606fe45e61da1fb5bf5a6d244fda5e7
Author: Roman Mohr <rmohr@redhat.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 25 09:34:17 2021 +0100

    Bump golang crypto library for better ssh protocol negotiations
    
    Fixes an issue where golang ssh can't connect to some ssh servers which
    do not accept ssh-rsa preauthentication and make the connetions fail
    with:
    
    ```
    userauth_pubkey: key type ssh-rsa not in PubkeyAcceptedKeyTypes [preauth]
    ```
    
    Signed-off-by: Roman Mohr <rmohr@redhat.com>

